@startuml
|User|
start
:Select Book to Review;
:Submit Review;

|App|
:Validate Session;
if (Validation successful?) then (No)
  :Display error "Login required";
  stop
else (Yes)
  :Forward Review Data;
endif

|ReviewService|
:Create Review record;
fork
  :Log Review Creation;
fork again
  |Database|
  :Insert Review;
  :Recalculate Rating;
end fork
|ReviewService|
:Return confirmation;

|App|
:Show confirmation to User;
stop
@enduml
